From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yugidraft <yugidraft@localhost>
Date: Sun, 2 Jan 2000 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] core: keep the stock Synchro material effect query order

Compare controllers or teams before the material effect query. Own material skips the query, as stock does. Extra Lua condition calls can change effect IDs and state.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UrYy4jjEcbJHKdcVYasfdb
---
 card.cpp | 8 +++++---
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/card.cpp b/card.cpp
index 7d43f4e..f3fdae0 100644
--- a/card.cpp
+++ b/card.cpp
@@ -4010,12 +4010,14 @@ int32_t card::is_can_be_synchro_material(card* scard, uint8_t playerid, card* /*
 		return FALSE;
 	if(!(get_type(scard, SUMMON_TYPE_SYNCHRO, playerid) & TYPE_MONSTER))
 		return FALSE;
-	if(scard && current.location == LOCATION_MZONE && !is_affected_by_effect(EFFECT_SYNCHRO_MATERIAL)) {
+	if(scard && current.location == LOCATION_MZONE) {
 		// More than two duelists (Tag): a monster of the partner is a Synchro material of the team ([R-TAG-PARTNER-COST]), like a
 		// monster of the own field. Free for all has no partner (same_team is false for two different duelists). Two duelists: stock test.
 		const auto& gf = *pduel->game_field;
-		if(gf.n_duelists == 2 ? current.controler != scard->current.controler
-		                      : !(gf.is_duelist(current.controler) && gf.is_duelist(scard->current.controler) && gf.same_team(current.controler, scard->current.controler)))
+		const bool other = gf.n_duelists == 2 ? current.controler != scard->current.controler
+		                      : !(gf.is_duelist(current.controler) && gf.is_duelist(scard->current.controler) && gf.same_team(current.controler, scard->current.controler));
+		// Keep stock short-circuit order: own material never queries this effect.
+		if(other && !is_affected_by_effect(EFFECT_SYNCHRO_MATERIAL))
 			return FALSE;
 	}
 	if(is_status(STATUS_FORBIDDEN))
